          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yosefe ŵatemi ku Iguputo ni mbumba ja baba ŵawo. Ndaŵi jiŵawaga ni kuti ali ŵa yaka 110. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yosefe ŵatemi ni umi mpaka ŵaweni ŵanace ŵa Efelemu ni yisukulu ya mpago watatu. Pa ndaŵi jiŵapagwile ŵanace ŵa Makili, mwanace jwamlume jwa Manase, Yosefe ŵapocele ŵanacewo mwiŵasa mwakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yosefe ŵasalile acalongo acimjakwe ŵala kuti, “Une sigele panandi kuwa, nambo Mlungu tacimsunga nditu, nipo tacimkoposya mcilambo acino, kwawula namwe ku cilambo ciŵaŵisile cilanga",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " kwa Abulahamu, Isaki ni Yakobo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 50:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaneko Yosefe ŵaŵendile acalongo acimjakwe ŵala kuti alumbile ni ŵatite, “Lumbilani kuti ndaŵi jele Mlungu tacimlongolela ku cele cilamboco, ticijigala cilu cangu kutyocela akuno.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.50.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.50.25"
            ]
          }
        },
