        {
          "text": "Myoyo Yosefe ŵawile ali akwete yaka 110 ku Iguputo, mtembo wakwe ŵawupacile mtela wakulekasya kuwola, nipo ŵawuŵisile mwibokosi.",
          "type": "text",
